{"page":510,"verses":[{"verse_key":"47:30","surah":47,"ayah":30,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَوْ نَشَآءُ لَأَرَيْنَـٰكَهُمْ فَلَعَرَفْتَهُم بِسِيمَـٰهُمْ ۚ وَلَتَعْرِفَنَّهُمْ فِى لَحْنِ ٱلْقَوْلِ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ يَعْلَمُ أَعْمَـٰلَكُمْ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We could even point them out to you [Prophet] if We wished, and then you could identify them by their marks, but you will know them anyway by the tone of their speech. God knows everything you [people] do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"47:30"},{"pos":2,"ar":"نَشَآءُ","en_gloss":"We willed","transliteration":"nashāu","verse_key":"47:30"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَأَرَيْنَـٰكَهُمْ","en_gloss":"surely, We could show them to you","transliteration":"la-araynākahum","verse_key":"47:30"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَلَعَرَفْتَهُم","en_gloss":"and you would know them","transliteration":"falaʿaraftahum","verse_key":"47:30"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِسِيمَـٰهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"by their marks","transliteration":"bisīmāhum","verse_key":"47:30"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَلَتَعْرِفَنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"but surely, you will know them","transliteration":"walataʿrifannahum","verse_key":"47:30"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"by","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"47:30"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَحْنِ","en_gloss":"(the) tone","transliteration":"laḥni","verse_key":"47:30"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْلِ ۚ","en_gloss":"(of their) speech","transliteration":"l-qawli","verse_key":"47:30"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"47:30"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"knows","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","verse_key":"47:30"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَعْمَـٰلَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your deeds","transliteration":"aʿmālakum","verse_key":"47:30"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٣٠","en_gloss":"(30)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"47:30"}]},{"verse_key":"47:31","surah":47,"ayah":31,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَنَبْلُوَنَّكُمْ حَتَّىٰ نَعْلَمَ ٱلْمُجَـٰهِدِينَ مِنكُمْ وَٱلصَّـٰبِرِينَ وَنَبْلُوَا۟ أَخْبَارَكُمْ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We shall test you to see which of you strive your hardest and are steadfast; We shall test the sincerity of your assertions.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَنَبْلُوَنَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"And surely We will test you","transliteration":"walanabluwannakum","verse_key":"47:31"},{"pos":2,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"47:31"},{"pos":3,"ar":"نَعْلَمَ","en_gloss":"We make evident","transliteration":"naʿlama","verse_key":"47:31"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْمُجَـٰهِدِينَ","en_gloss":"those who strive","transliteration":"l-mujāhidīna","verse_key":"47:31"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِنكُمْ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"47:31"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلصَّـٰبِرِينَ","en_gloss":"and the patient ones","transliteration":"wal-ṣābirīna","verse_key":"47:31"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَنَبْلُوَا۟","en_gloss":"and We will test","transliteration":"wanabluwā","verse_key":"47:31"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَخْبَارَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your affairs","transliteration":"akhbārakum","verse_key":"47:31"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٣١","en_gloss":"(31)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"47:31"}]},{"verse_key":"47:32","surah":47,"ayah":32,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ وَصَدُّوا۟ عَن سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ وَشَآقُّوا۟ ٱلرَّسُولَ مِنۢ بَعْدِ مَا تَبَيَّنَ لَهُمُ ٱلْهُدَىٰ لَن يَضُرُّوا۟ ٱللَّهَ شَيْـًٔا وَسَيُحْبِطُ أَعْمَـٰلَهُمْ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who disbelieve, bar others from God’s path, and oppose the Messenger when they have been shown guidance, do not harm God in any way. He will make their deeds go to waste-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"47:32"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"47:32"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"47:32"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَصَدُّوا۟","en_gloss":"and turn away","transliteration":"waṣaddū","verse_key":"47:32"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"fr