ste-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"47:33"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"47:33"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"47:33"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَطِيعُوا۟","en_gloss":"Obey","transliteration":"aṭīʿū","verse_key":"47:33"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"47:33"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَأَطِيعُوا۟","en_gloss":"and obey","transliteration":"wa-aṭīʿū","verse_key":"47:33"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلرَّسُولَ","en_gloss":"the Messenger","transliteration":"l-rasūla","verse_key":"47:33"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"47:33"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تُبْطِلُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"make vain","transliteration":"tub'ṭilū","verse_key":"47:33"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَعْمَـٰلَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your deeds","transliteration":"aʿmālakum","verse_key":"47:33"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٣٣","en_gloss":"(33)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"47:33"}]},{"verse_key":"47:34","surah":47,"ayah":34,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ وَصَدُّوا۟ عَن سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ ثُمَّ مَاتُوا۟ وَهُمْ كُفَّارٌ فَلَن يَغْفِرَ ٱللَّهُ لَهُمْ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God will not forgive those who disbelieve, bar others from God’s path, and die as disbelievers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"47:34"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"47:34"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"47:34"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَصَدُّوا۟","en_gloss":"and turn away","transliteration":"waṣaddū","verse_key":"47:34"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"47:34"},{"pos":6,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"47:34"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"47:34"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"47:34"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَاتُوا۟","en_gloss":"died","transliteration":"mātū","verse_key":"47:34"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"while they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"47:34"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كُفَّارٌۭ","en_gloss":"(were) disbelievers","transliteration":"kuffārun","verse_key":"47:34"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَلَن","en_gloss":"never","transliteration":"falan","verse_key":"47:34"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَغْفِرَ","en_gloss":"will Allah forgive","transliteration":"yaghfira","verse_key":"47:34"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"will Allah forgive","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"47:34"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"47:34"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٣٤","en_gloss":"(34)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"47:34"}]},{"verse_key":"47:35","surah":47,"ayah":35,"ar_uthmani":"فَلَا تَهِنُوا۟ وَتَدْعُوٓا۟ إِلَى ٱلسَّلْمِ وَأَنتُمُ ٱلْأَعْلَوْنَ وَٱللَّهُ مَعَكُمْ وَلَن يَتِرَكُمْ أَعْمَـٰلَكُمْ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"So [believers] do not lose heart and cry out for peace. It is you who have the upper hand: God is with you. He will not begrudge you the reward for your [good] deeds:","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"So (do) not","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"47:35"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَهِنُوا۟","en_gloss":"weaken","transliteration":"tahinū","verse_key":"47:35"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَتَدْعُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"and call","transliteration":"watadʿū","verse_key":"47:35"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"for","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"47:35"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلسَّلْمِ","en_gloss":"peace","transliteration":"l-salmi","verse_key":"47:35"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَأَنتُمُ","en_gloss":"while you","transliteration":"wa-antumu","verse_key":"47:35"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْأَعْلَوْنَ","en_gloss":"(are) superior","transliteration":"l-aʿlawna","verse_key":"47:35"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"and Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"47:35"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَعَكُمْ","en_gloss":"(is) with you","transliteration":"maʿakum","verse_key":"47:35"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلَن","en_gloss":"and never","transliteration":"walan","verse_key":"47:35"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَتِرَكُمْ","en_gloss":"will deprive you","transliteration":"yatirakum","verse_key":"47:35"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَعْمَـٰلَكُمْ","en_gloss":"(of) your deeds","transliteration":"aʿmālakum","verse_key":"47:35"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٣٥","en_gloss":"(35)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"47:35"}]},{"verse_key":"47:36","surah":47,"ayah":36,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ ٱلدُّنْيَا لَعِبٌ وَلَهْوٌ ۚ وَإِن تُؤْمِنُوا۟ وَتَتَّقُوا۟ يُؤْتِكُمْ أُجُورَكُمْ وَلَا يَسْـَٔلْكُمْ أَمْوَٰلَكُمْ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"the life of this world is only a game, a pastime, but if you believe and are mindful of God, He will recompense you. He does not ask you to give up [all] your posses-sions-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"Only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"47:36"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ","en_gloss":"the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayatu","verse_key":"47:36"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"47:36"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَعِبٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) play","transliteration":"laʿibun","verse_key":"47:36"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَلَهْوٌۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"and amusement","transliteration":"walahwun","verse_key":"47:36"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"47:36"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تُؤْمِنُوا۟","en_gloss":"you believe","transliteration":"tu'minū","verse_key":"47:36"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَتَتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"and fear (Allah)","transliteration":"watattaqū","verse_key":"47:36"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يُؤْتِكُمْ","en_gloss":"He will give you","transliteration":"yu'tikum","verse_key":"47:36"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أُجُورَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your rewards","transliteration":"ujūrakum","verse_k